            "title": "GLOW™ Foaming Cleanser",
            "text": "<p><strong>16 Natural Ingredients: </strong>​Aqua, Decyl Glucoside (natural surfactant from coconut), Caprylyl / Capryl Glucoside (natural vegetable surfactant from coconut oil), Vegetable Glycerin, Gluconolactone and Sodium Benzoate (GeogardUltraTM a patented natural preservative), Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil, Juniperus Communis Fruit Oil, Citrus Limon (Lemon) Peel Oil, Salvia Sclarea (Clary) Oil, Clay (Mineral Microbiome ClayTM), Hydroxyethylcellulose (natural plant cellulose), Citric Acid​<br/><br/></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_b7UJ9X": {
