            "text": "<p><strong>20 Natural Ingredients: </strong>​Aqua, Kaolin White Clay, Magnesium Aluminum Silicate (Bentonite Clay), Vegetable Glycerin, Clay (Mineral Microbiome ClayTM), Aloe BarbadensisLeaf Juice, Gluconolactone and Sodium Benzoate (GeogardUltraTM a patented natural preservative), Prunus Armeniaca (Apricot) Kernel Oil, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Citrus Nobilis (Mandarin Orange), Potassium Sorbate (natural pH balancer from fruits), Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Oil, Pelargonium Graveolins (Geranium) Flower Oil, Camellia Sinensis (Green Tea) Leaf Extract, Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract, Helichrysum Halicuna (Helichrysum) Oil, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil, OcimumBasilicum (Basil) Oil, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Resemary) Leaf Oil​<br/><br/></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
