    "text_columns_98PtGy": {
      "type": "text-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_fQyFJD": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GLOWFoamingCleanser.jpg",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Cleanse: GLOW® Foaming Facial Cleanser",
            "text": "<p>Jojoba Seed Oil a natural anti-inflammatory ingredient to help reduce redness caused by dryness and calms skin.</p><p>Curated oil blend to balance skin with anti-bacterial and anti-inflammation properties.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_xNwc34": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GLOWExfoliatingScrub.jpg",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Treatment 1: GLOW® Exfoliating Scrub",
            "text": "<p>Use of apricot seed powder, which is ultra fine and acts as a physical exfoliant to gently remove damaged, dry and dead skin cells (not to be confused with ground-up apricot seed, which is more coarse and causes abrasions to the skin). No use of chemical exfoliants to avoid irritation.</p><p>Rich natural blend of ingredients to nourish and replenish skin while exfoliating without leaving the skin feeling stripped.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_b8Gd9q": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GLOWFacialMaskELLEFinalist_2643fd3f-2522-45a6-a7c8-29142bcfa335.jpg",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Treatment 2: GLOW® Facial Mask",
            "text": "<p>Mineral Microbiome Clay®, Kaolin, and Bentonite Clay to absorb excess oil, sebum, and impurities while restoring skin with 40+ minerals known to help promote recovery and restoration of skin.</p><p>Clears the skin of daily buildup, pollutants, and aggressors.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_n7HEgP": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GLOWFacialMistELLEWinner.jpg",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Treatment 3: GLOW® Facial Mist",
            "text": "<p>Alcohol free to calm and replenish skin.</p><p>Rose water to help soothe, moisturize, calm, and refresh the skin.</p><p>Witch Hazel (alcohol free) to help remove excess oils and tighten pores priming skin.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_KjD6Rw": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GLOWFacialSerumELLEFinalist.jpg",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Treatment 4: GLOW® Facial Serum",
            "text": "<p>Powerful blend of oils in a non-sticky serum to hydrate and nourish skin.</p><p>Evening primrose oil to moisturize, soothe and help increase skin elasticity.</p><p>Curated oil blend to help promote hydration, help even and protect skin.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_Nni84m": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GLOWEyeCreamELLEWinner.jpg",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Treatment 5: GLOW® Eye Cream",
            "text": "<p>Camellia oil to help stimulate collagen production and help fight fine lines.</p><p>Green coffee to help reduce puffiness and dark circles.</p><p>Curated oil blend to care for delicate skin around eyes with anti-inflammatory and anti-microbial properties.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_nVVqAA": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GLOWDailyMoisturizer.jpg",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Care: GLOW® Daily Moisturizer",
            "text": "<p>Loaded with anti-inflammatory oils to promote care and restoration of skin.</p><p>Jojoba oil: anti-inflammatory properties to help reduce redness and calm the skin.</p><p>Apricot oil: to help improve skin tone and promote radiance.</p><p>LexFeel™ patented natural emollient to replace synthetic silicone for fast absorption and texture without the irritation.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
