    "faq_XpMHc9": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_LdCzpH": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who is the Aging Skin Routine for?",
            "text": "<p>This routine is made for anyone experiencing signs of aging like fine lines, wrinkles, dark spots, loss of firmness, or dullness. It’s especially helpful for those looking for a gentle, natural way to support mature skin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_V4wNRq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What kind of results can I expect?",
            "text": "<p>With consistent use, you can expect smoother texture, more even tone, improved hydration, and a visible glow. Many users also notice softening of fine lines and more firmness in their skin over time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_EE96i6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use this routine if I have sensitive skin?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! This routine is made with 100% natural, non-irritating ingredients—free from harsh actives, synthetic fragrances, and common irritants. It’s gentle enough for sensitive or reactive skin types.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_PcxjyF": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes this different from other anti-aging products?",
            "text": "<p>Unlike anti-aging products that rely on synthetic ingredients or aggressive treatments, our routine uses <strong>nature’s most effective botanicals</strong> to support skin as it ages—gently, holistically, and without compromise.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_VRhWay": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use the products individually, or do I need the full routine?",
            "text": "<p>While each product can be used on its own, the full routine is designed to work synergistically—cleansing gently, calming inflammation, restoring hydration, and supporting the skin barrier at every step.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_pYhpKb": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does the \"Try it. Love it. Keep it.\" program work?",
            "text": "<p>We’re not just another skincare brand—and this isn’t just another product. Instead of handing you one more serum to guess your way through, we created <em>The Art of Skin</em>: complete routines designed to calm, repair, and restore balance to irritated skin. </p><p>Every formula is scientifically crafted using nature’s most powerful ingredients—and in testing, they’ve outperformed even the most high-end, clinical brands. </p><p>No harsh actives, no unnecessary fillers—just real, effective skincare that works in harmony with your skin. And because we know you’ll feel the difference, we’re letting you try the routine that’s right for you, completely risk-free.</p><p>Here's how it works:</p><p>1.<strong> Try it.</strong> Order the <em>Irritated Skin Routine</em> today and we’ll send it straight to your door—no upfront cost. You’ll have 14 days from placing the order to test it out, morning and night, and see how your skin responds.</p><p>2.<strong> Love it. </strong>Feel the difference. We formulated this routine with soothing, barrier-friendly ingredients for sensitive, dry, inflamed, and reactive skin. If your skin says yes—you’ll know.</p><p>3. <strong>Keep it. </strong>At the end of your trial, keep what you love - or return anything that didn’t work for you. You’ll only be charged for the items you decide to keep—no pressure, no hassle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_qWJwCW": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are your products natural?",
            "text": "<p>Every Back To Earth product is 100% natural. No nasties. Ever.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_LMCqiE": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the Mineral Microbiome Clay Complex™, and what does it do?",
            "text": "<p>This proprietary blend is rich in essential minerals that nourish your skin, helps support its microbiome, and enhance its natural radiance.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
